We trust in an actual man, who was actually killed, and who actually raised from the dead.
Muhammad the prophet in the Islamic faith, is dead.
And this in no way harms a Muslim’s faith.
So we know where the Buddha’s body is.
Confucius’ body is buried in his birthplace in China.
