When using a roller-driven belt conveyor for transportation, the following regulations should be observed:
② There should be sufficient lighting in the roadway.
④ Temperature protection, smoke protection and automatic sprinkler devices should be installed.
⑥The use of flammable transmission medium is strictly prohibited for the fluid coupling (the speed-regulating fluid coupling is not subject to this limitation).
In inclined shafts, spring-type or heavy-hammer brakes must be installed. The performance of the brakes should meet the following requirements: The ratio of the braking torque and the designed maximum static tension difference on the brake wheel should not be less than 2.
① The vertical distance from the conveyor belt to the top of the roadway within the 20m section of the upper and lower personnel shall not be less than 1.4 m, the vertical distance in the driving section shall not be less than 1m. When traveling down the belt, the vertical distance between the upper and lower conveyor belts shall not be less than 1m.
③ The distance between passengers shall not be less than 4m. The occupants are not allowed to stand or lie on their backs, they should face the direction of travel, and it is strictly forbidden to carry heavy and overlong objects, and it is strictly forbidden to touch the side of the conveyor belt.
The belt conveyor has a strong conveying capacity, but some improper operations in actual use will cause the belt to slip.
Some belt conveyors have been improved and equipped with protection switches, which mainly detect the rotation speed of the drum. If the rotation speed of the drive drum and the turnaround drum are inconsistent, the protection switch will stop the equipment within ten seconds and stop the loss in time.
The material of the ceramic encapsulation can effectively increase the friction between the driving drum and the belt. Although this material is more expensive than ordinary materials, it has a long service life and does not require frequent replacement, which is beneficial Improve the production efficiency of belt conveyors.
Add soft start protection device. The soft start of the belt conveyor means that the conveyor gradually accelerates from a static state to a rated speed, which reduces the impact force on the belt, motor, and belt frame when the equipment starts, and also avoids belt slippage.
Improve production coordination and strengthen daily maintenance. The daily inspection and production training of the conveyor can find and correct problems in time, ensure the reliable operation of the equipment, and improve production efficiency.
